      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, that's helpful. One thing that's been bothering me though is that we occasionally have these weird instances where a stack looks perfectly fine, but then it'll just seemingly shift or tilt slightly out of nowhere, even when there's no obvious vibration or floor movement. It feels almost intentional, like something's messing with the balance. Are there any external or subtle factors that could cause a stack to shift like that?",
